easy.body:
Easy mode is made for learning:

• you start with €3M instead of €2M;
• at most 2 crises per sprint instead of 3;
• the negative effects of crises are halved.

Easy mode scores have their own leaderboard: they don't count in the global leaderboard.

hiring.body:
Each candidate states the salary they want. Adjust your offer before sending it:

• under 75% of their ask, they always refuse;
• at 110% or more, they always accept;
• in between, it's a negotiation: the closer your offer is to their ask, the more likely they accept.

The team is limited by the office size: 2 people in the garage, 6 at Seed, 15 at Series A, 30 as a Unicorn. A salary is paid every month: hire when your cash can keep up.
